DietNetwork

The BSD 3-Clause License in LICENSE covers this repository's own code: the
`dietnet` package in src/dietnet/, its tests, scripts and documentation.

Dietnet_train_and_evaluate/ (shipped inside the wheel as
dietnet/_upstream/Dietnet_train_and_evaluate) is HussinLab's code, unmodified,
from https://github.com/HussinLab/DIETNETWORK, the implementation behind

    Rochefort-Boulanger, Scicluna et al. (2026), American Journal of Human
    Genetics.

It is redistributed here so that an installed `dietnet` runs exactly the
published training and model code. Its copyright remains with its authors, and
the licence above does not cover it.
